# CODEOWNERS for craton-shield
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins. More-specific rules appear
# later in the file so they override the generic default.
#
# Teams referenced here must exist under the @craton-co GitHub organization.
# See MAINTAINERS.md and GOVERNANCE.md for the responsibilities of each team.

# --- Default owners -----------------------------------------------------------
# Every file not matched by a later rule falls to the core maintainers.
*                                   @craton-co/core-maintainers

# --- Repository-wide governance & policy --------------------------------------
/LICENSE                            @craton-co/founders
/NOTICE                             @craton-co/founders
