/ARCHITECTURE.md                    @craton-co/core-maintainers
/INSTALL.md                         @craton-co/core-maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @craton-co/core-maintainers
/ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md                 @craton-co/core-maintainers
/SUPPORT.md                         @craton-co/core-maintainers

